cer\",\n        \"M-stable\",\n        \"M-recover\",\n        \"M-fastpath\"\n      ],\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"selections\",\n        \"match\": {\n          \"operation_id\": \"6e3c194a63434c27967042e081d21a43\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"feedback\": {\n        \"ref_ids\": [\n          \"M-commit\",\n          \"M-leader\",\n          \"M-append\",\n          \"M-vote-producer\",\n          \"M-stable\",\n          \"M-recover\",\n          \"M-fastpath\"\n        ],\n        \"answered\": \"The captured implementation scopes quorum accounting to a leader object, restricts match support to configured voters, and requires a current-term entry before advancement. Old replication has a captured accounting pointer. Source also exposes a cached-tail failure path and separately persisted vote fields; neither has yet been grounded as a defect.\",\n        \"remaining\": [\n          \"Finish core authority transfer and heartbeat dispatch relationships before selecting a formal Candidate.\",\n          \"Investigate failed replacement StoreLogs legality and whether stale cached history can affect later predecessor validation or elections.\",\n          \"Investigate separate vote-field persistence under interruption or error without assuming storage failure semantics.\"\n        ],\n        \"understanding\": \"updated\",\n        \"rationale\": \"These are source observations and precise open premises, not executed evidence.\",\n        \"question_updates\": {}\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pending_work\": [],\n  \"current\": {\n    \"phase\": \"executed\",\n    \"operation_id\": \"6e3c194a63434c27967042e081d21a43\",\n    \"action\": \"research\"\n  },\n  \"latest_decision\": {\n    \"operation_id\": \"6e3c194a63434c27967042e081d21a43\",\n    \"action\": \"research\",\n    \"record\": {\n      \"path\": \"state.json\",\n      \"collection\": \"selections\",\n      \"match\": {\n        \"operation_id\": \"6e3c19